# NOT ignored on purpose: fuzz/ and .clusterfuzzlite/. The ClusterFuzzLite image
# (.clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile) builds from this same context — it does
# `COPY . $SRC/cordon` plus `COPY .clusterfuzzlite/build.sh`, and build.sh
# bundles fuzz/*.fuzz.ts and zips fuzz/seeds/. Ignoring either breaks the fuzz
# build with "not found". The runtime Dockerfile COPYs only package*.json,
# tsconfig.json and src/, so neither directory reaches the shipped image.
